MAQUINA_DESCRIPCION_PINZA_REPARADORA;The cable repairing pliers are designed to fix cables, either live or de-energized, by clamping onto the cable and repairing it internally without cutting or removing any parts.<br>The pliers have a specialized head that can strip away any damaged insulation from the cable and create a clean and conductive connection.
MAQUINA_DESCRIPCION_SOLDADORA;The <b>Welding Machine</b> allows you to repair pipes and containers.
MAQUINA_DESCRIPCION_ELECTROGENO;<b>Diesel Generators</b> can power the plant while the turbines are shut down.
MAQUINA_DESCRIPCION_BOMBA_CIRCULACION;<b>Circulation Pumps</b> move water inside the primary circuit, secondary circuit, and cooling circuit.
MAQUINA_DESCRIPCION_BOMBA_CARGA;Freight pumps allow liquid to be injected into the reactor pipes.
MAQUINA_DESCRIPCION_TURBINA_GENERADORA;The generator turbine converts the kinetic energy of the steam into rotational motion for the electric turbine.
MAQUINA_DESCRIPCION_EVAPORADOR;<b>Steam Generators</b> boil secondary circuit water into steam.
