UI013;AO PROTOCOLS
UI013A;<b>IGN | Ignition Protocol:</b> The Operating Assistant has the ability to activate the modules, prepare the conditions, initiate the ignition protocol and regulate the parameters until the Reactor has reached Critical Mass.
UI013B;<b>CON | Reactor Control:</b> The Operating Assistant has the ability to keep the Reactor running constantly, within the general parameters of safe operation.
UI013C;<b>EME | Emergency Protocol:</b> The Operating Assistant has the ability to respond to a high or critical emergency, take control of the Reactor and perform the necessary maneuvers to stabilize the Core.
UI013D;<b>FUP | Fuel Protocol:</b> The Operating Assistant has the ability to dispose of spent fuel cells in special containers, and to manipulate new blocks to supply the Reactor.
UI013E;<b>STO | Emergency Stop:</b> The Operating Assistant has the ability to detect a terminal crisis and carry out the necessary maneuvers to prevent it.
