MSNTITULO1;Reactor startup
MSNDESCRIPCION1;To achieve the goal, you must start the Reactor startup protocol and start generating power.<br>No specific energy quota is required.<br>There may be interruptions.<br>But before the cutoff time, you must have generated power for the requested time.
MSNTITULO2;Accumulated energy
MSNDESCRIPCION2;To achieve the goal, you must generate the requested amount of energy.<br>There may be outages, but before the cutoff time, you must have generated the requested amount of power.
MSNTITULO3;Power peak
MSNDESCRIPCION3;To achieve the goal, you must generate a peak of energy beyond the operating limit.<br>There can be no interruptions during the requested time.<br>
MSNTITULO99;Service Compliance
MSNDESCRIPCION99;You must prepare the reactor to constantly meet the requested energy demand, which may vary depending on the time of day, the weather or other events, such as other power plants going out of service or specific requirements of high demand.
