L0002E_DESC_ACTIVACIONES;WE WILL CHECK ONE BY ONE THE CONTROL CONSOLES, THE OPERATION OF THE REACTOR AND THE INITIAL MODULES NECESSARY FOR START-UP.
L0002E_DESC_SETEO;GENERAL PREPARATION FOR START-UP OF THE REACTOR, ATTENTION TO THE PARAMETERS AND SAFETY CONSIDERATIONS.
L0002E_DESC_ESTABILIZACION;WE WILL REVIEW THE NECESSARY STEPS FOR THE STABLE OPERATION OF THE REACTOR WITHIN THE OPERATING PARAMETERS.
L0002E_DESC_PARADA;MANEUVER TO STOP THE REACTOR DUE TO EMERGENCY OR TO CARRY OUT MAINTENANCE TASKS.<br>COOLING THE CORE.
