GM006;No License To Operate Reactor
GM_T_GOLPE;YOU HAVE DIED
GM_D_GOLPE;The game is over. You must avoid health damage and pay attention to the red health bar and green radiation bar in the upper left corner. If your health drops, try walking slowly or staying still for a few minutes until your health has recovered.<br>If your radiation bar drops, try using the Potassium Iodide injector station in the Control Room or Airlock Room.
GM_T_EXPLOSION;DEATH BY EXPLOSION
GM_D_EXPLOSION;You have perished because you were too close to an explosion. You must avoid all explosions and pay attention to the health meter in the upper left corner. If your health drops, try walking slowly or staying still for a few minutes until your health has recovered.
GM_T_RADIOACTIVIDAD;DEATH BY RADIATION POISONING
GM_D_RADIOACTIVIDAD;Your body was poisoned with a fatal dose of radioactive nuclides. Walking through a contaminated room will cause you to track contamination around the facility, and this contamination will cause you to get very sick.
GM_T_FUEGO;BURNED ALIVE
GM_D_FUEGO;You sustained fatal burns. Avoid fire and hot areas such as the pressurizer, and watch the health meter in the upper left corner. If your health drops, walk slowly or stay still until it recovers.
GM_T_CAIDA;FALLEN TO YOUR DEATH
GM_D_CAIDA;The Nucleares Corporation has installed all necessary physical barriers to ensure physical safety, and therefore assumes no responsibility from your injury or death. AO has submitted a NAEC report for this incident.
GM_T_AGUA;DROWNED
GM_D_AGUA;Your character cannot swim and has drowned. You must avoid falling into water or wading too deep under water.
GM_T_ELECTRICIDAD;ELECTROCUTION
GM_D_ELECTRICIDAD;You were killed by an electric shock, and AO was unable to revive you. Please exercise increased electrical safety in your next playthrough.
GM_T_SIN_LICENCIA;LICENSE REVOKED
GM_D_SIN_LICENCIA;You have not met the National Atomic Energy Commission's standards for safe nuclear power production. Please comply with audit recommendations in future playthroughs.
GM_T_APLASTAMIENTO;CRUSHED TO DEATH
GM_D_APLASTAMIENTO;Your head and body were crushed by a 9-ton concrete/lead blast shield. In future playthroughs, please don't play around the safety equipment. Now AO needs to clean up the mess you made.
IN001;"When there's no more room in hell, the dead will walk the earth."
IN002;George A.<br>Romero\nDawn of the Dead
