BA_T_NIVEL_CALIDAD_AYUDA_0;Textures will appear blurry and very poorly defined.<br>Lowest memory consumption should improve game performance.
BA_T_NIVEL_CALIDAD_AYUDA_1;Textures will look fuzzy.<br>Moderate memory consumption may improve game performance.
BA_T_NIVEL_CALIDAD_AYUDA_2;[Recommended option] Textures will look sharp.<br>High memory consumption could impact game performance.
BA_T_NIVEL_CALIDAD_AYUDA_3;The textures will look very well defined and clear.<br>Very high memory consumption may impact game performance.
BA_T_POSTPROCESO;Post-processing:
