BA_T_POSTPROCESO_AYUDA_0;[Recommended Option] Advanced color, light and glow effects will be enabled, significantly increasing the graphics quality of the game, but may slightly reduce performance.
BA_T_POSTPROCESO_AYUDA_1;All advanced effects will be disabled to improve performance, but the game's visual experience will be drastically affected.<br>Only apply in settings with very low graphics performance.
BA_T_LUCES_VOLUMETRICAS;Volumetric lights:
BA_T_LUCES_VOLUMETRICAS_0;Disabled
