BA_T_LUCES_VOLUMETRICAS_AYUDA_0;Turn off the depth effect on the lights to improve game performance.
BA_T_LUCES_VOLUMETRICAS_AYUDA_1;[EXPERIMENTAL] Improves the atmosphere by creating a depth and fog effect in the lights, but may reduce game performance.
BA_T_LUCES_VOLUMETRICAS_AYUDA_2;[EXPERIMENTAL] Improves the atmosphere by creating a dynamic fog and depth effect on the lights, but can significantly reduce game performance.
BA_T_LUCES_DINAMICAS;Realtime Lighting
BA_T_LUCES_DINAMICAS_0;Disabled
BA_T_LUCES_DINAMICAS_1;Activated
