BA_T_LUCES_DINAMICAS_AYUDA_1;Realtime lighting will brighten or darken certain areas, improving game experience.<br>Computer with advanced GPU strongly recommended.
BA_T_SOMBRAS;Shadow quality:
BA_T_SOMBRAS_0;No Shadows
