BA_T_SOMBRAS_CALIDAD_1;Shadows appear rough, straight-edged, and fuzzy.<br>Slightly reduced performance.
BA_T_SOMBRAS_CALIDAD_2;[Recommended] Good quality shadows, with defined shading effect on game elements.
BA_T_SOMBRAS_CALIDAD_3;Shadows are high quality, with a very well defined shading effect on game elements.<br>GPU recommended.
BA_T_SOMBRAS_CALIDAD_4;Shadows have an excellent shading effect on the elements of the game.<br>GPU recommended.
