MODO_SANDBOX;The reactor is at your disposal.<br>You can choose the initial setup.<br>There are no events or challenges, you cannot earn Prestige Points.
MODO_SIMULADOR;You start the simulation with a basic setup and you can progress through events and challenges.<br>The simulation includes the management, times and logistics of a reactor.
