BO_CK_LOG_REACTOR;Log reactor activity
T_LogReactor;Saves reactor activity in a separate .log file next to the XML savegame file.<br>Reactor activity log can also be viewed from the tablet.
APP_AYUDA_4;Wear and Integrity
APP_AYUDA_D_4;The game engine tracks component Wear and Integrity to ensure that operators are properly maintaining plant equipment, and not damaging the equipment.<br><br>Normal gameplay causes an increase in each component's Wear, ranging from 0% (brand new/refurbished) to 100% (completely worn down).<br><br>Abnormal gameplay causes a loss of Integrity. The Integrity value shows how much component health is left before it is destroyed. Virtually all equipment can be damaged due to abnormal use. Once wear reaches 50%, continuing to use that equipment will cause a loss of Integrity. Items may explode, burn, or fail to perform their function once Integrity is reduced to zero.<br><br>Components must be turned off before they are maintained by AO. Damaged Hazmat suits cannot be repaired.
