AY_SOLDADORA;Welding machine@The welder enables repairs on metal tubes and containers.<br>To complete a repair, you must weld the entire damaged surface.<br><br> The size of the weld will vary according to the time you keep the welder on the same spot, but it will also increase the temperature, potentially causing the welded object to melt instead of being repaired.<br><b>You have three attempts to accomplish the task.</b><br><br>If you fail three times in a single repair, the damage can only be repaired by AO.@Ayuda_SOLDADORA
