APP_AYUDA_5;Reverse Meltdown Minigame
APP_AYUDA_D_5;When the core is nearly destroyed, a countdown timer will appear on the screen. This starts a minigame which requires two out of three criteria to win.<br><br>1. Lower all fuel cell temperatures to less than 180°C.<br>2. Maintain the integrity of ALL installed control rods.<br>3. Remove ALL fuel cells from the core.<br><br>Fuel cell temperature gauges are located in the FUEL panel of the Control Room.<br><br>The most effective method is to press SCRAM and speed up time [3 key]. However, you will not be able to win if any installed control rod is damaged to the point where it disappears from the control rod display, or if you cannot dispose of all installed fuel cells before the timer runs out. If you cannot win, it may be prudent to Escape via Train.<br><br>If you win the minigame, you will receive a very large Prestige Point bonus, and the plant will be decontaminated. All damaged fuel cells or control rods will be removed, and you will be able to order and install new fuel cells and new control rods. You will be able to save your progress again after the plant is decontaminated.
