AO_HABILIDAD_MantenimientoDeResistores;Maintain Resistor Banks
AO_HABILIDAD_D_MantenimientoDeResistores;<b>RESISTOR BANKS</b> are designed to absorb excess Turbine Generator electricity and convert into heat.<br><br>Each Resistor Bank has up to four (4) <b>RESISTOR BLOCKS</b>. Worn or burned resistance blocks will not be able to absorb electricity and will cause overheating, fire, and possibly explosion.<br><br>If you buy this upgrade for <sprite=0>{0} Prestige Points, you can task AO to control the Resistor Banks to ensure uninterrupted operation.<br><br>Resistor Blocks must be purchased separately through your tablet's "ORDER PARTS & SUPPLIES" app.
