AYUDA_UI_MOCHILA_INFO_02;<color=yellow>ACTIONS ON OBJECTS</color><br><br>To pick up an item from the backpack and place it in the player's hands, <b>LEFT CLICK</b> on the item.<br>To take it out of the backpack and throw it on the ground, <b>RIGHT CLICK</b> on the item.
AYUDA_UI_MOCHILA_INFO_03;<color=yellow>STORE</color><br><br>To store the object that the player has in his hands inside the backpack, look for a container with empty spaces and <b>LEFT CLICK</b> on that container.
