D_GEN_REQ_POTENCIA_kW;Megawatts requested by the city's grid operator. Your goal is to produce enough power to satisfy this demand.<br><br>Value will update every hour. See "Service Compliance" app on your tablet to see future demand and past compliance.
T_PN_TE_RPM;RPM
D_PN_TE_RPM;Real-time measurement of the number of revolutions the turbine makes per minute.<br>Changes in speed can indicate adjustments in power output and contribute to optimizing the overall efficiency of the power generation process.<br>
