T_GEN_ACTUAL_AMPERIOS;GENERATOR | AMPERES
D_GEN_ACTUAL_AMPERIOS;This display provides real-time information about the excitation current flowing through the turbine generator.<br>Excitation current is a crucial factor in controlling the magnetic field within the generator and, consequently, the voltage output.
T_CajaPanelSyncBreaker;TRANSFORMER | CIRCUIT BREAKER
D_CajaPanelSyncBreaker;<color=green>Green</color> lamp indicates that the transformer is connected to the grid.<br><br><color=red>Red</color> lamp indicates that the generator is not connected to the grid.
T_CajaPanelSync;TRANSFORMER | SYNC STATUS
D_CajaPanelSync;<color=green>Green</color> lamp indicates that the transformer is in phase with the city grid.<br><br><color=red>Red</color> lamp indicates that the generator is out of phase with the city grid.
