T_MD_Volumen_Boro;BORIC ACID
D_MD_Volumen_Boro;Boric Acid can be dosed into the reactor core to limit nuclear fission rates. It is a beneficial reactor poison which can be added and removed using the controls on this panel.
T_MD_Volumen_Fuel;DIESEL FUEL
D_MD_Volumen_Fuel;Diesel fuel tank is located on top of the Diesel Generator building for long-term outages.
