T_TecladoNumerico_SET_BORO;BORON DOSE PER MINUTE
D_TecladoNumerico_SET_BORO;Orders the Boron Dosing Pump to add between 0 and 50 grams of boric acid per minute. Set to 0 to turn off.<br><br><color=red>WARNING:</color> The Boron Dosing Pump will overload if the core is filled beyond capacity (2,500 L³).
