D_LUZ_SUM_EXTERNO_ENERGIA;Green = Plant is receiving power from city grid.<br><br>Grey = Plant is not connected to the external power supply.<br><br>Red = City is not providing power due to local outage or unpaid bills.
DETALLE_NIVEL_DIFICULTAD_COMPLETO_-1;<b>DIFFICULTY LEVEL: <color=green>TUTORIAL</color></b><br><br>- Step-by-step tutorial of reactor, steam generators, vacuum pump, and turbines.<br><br>- Prestige Points are paid hourly for each MWe generated and delivered by the transformers.<br><br>- Grid demand is 50% lower in "Demand Follows Level" mode.<br><br>- No penalties for overdelivery or underdelivery.<br><br>- Maintenance costs are 50% lower.<br><br>- The plant is not subject to audits.<br><br>- City does not turn off external power supply for unpaid bills.<br><br>- Chemical behavior of liquids and gases not simulated.
DETALLE_NIVEL_DIFICULTAD_COMPLETO_0;<b>DIFFICULTY LEVEL: <color=green>EASY</color></b><br><br>- Prestige Points are paid hourly for each MWe generated and delivered by the transformers.<br><br>- Grid Demand is 25% lower in "Demand Follows Level" mode.<br><br>- Upon reaching Level 3, the plant must meet the city's demand.<br><br>- Upon reaching Level 3, overdelivery or underdelivery beyond ±10% can cause the grid to become unstable.<br><br>- Maintenance costs are 25% lower.<br><br>- The plant is not subject to audits.<br><br>- City will not turn off external power supply for unpaid bills.
DETALLE_NIVEL_DIFICULTAD_COMPLETO_1;<b>DIFFICULTY LEVEL: <color=green>NORMAL</color></b><br><br>- Prestige Points are paid hourly for each MWe generated and delivered by the transformers.<br><br>- The plant must meet the city's demand at all times.<br><br>- Overdelivery or underdelivery beyond ±10% can cause the grid to become unstable.<br><br>- The plant is audited periodically.<br><br>- The city will cut off backup electric service after 7 days of unpaid bills.
DETALLE_NIVEL_DIFICULTAD_COMPLETO_2;<b>DIFFICULTY LEVEL: <color=green>ADVANCED</color></b><br><br>- Maintenance costs are relative to the value of the component.<br><br>- The city can partially absorb the excess energy generated during a short period (if it exceeds less than 10%).<br><br>- The plant is audited periodically.<br><br>- The plant must meet the city's demand at all times.<br><br>- No Prestige Points are earned for excess energy generated.<br><br>- The city may cut off backup electric service for unpaid bills.
DETALLE_NIVEL_DIFICULTAD_-1;step-by-step tutorial. highly recommended!<br> <br>game can be played after tutorial ends.<br>no audits. 50% less demand. no penalties.<br>difficulty cannot be changed in-game.
DETALLE_NIVEL_DIFICULTAD_0;25% less demand and maintenance costs.<br>demand must be met once reaching level 3.<br>city external power always available.<br>no audits.<br>difficulty cannot be changed in-game.
DETALLE_NIVEL_DIFICULTAD_1;100% demand and maintenance costs.<br>demand must be met within ±10%.<br>power bills must be paid within deadline.<br>failed audits may impact operating licenses.<br>difficulty cannot be changed in-game.
DETALLE_NIVEL_DIFICULTAD_2;100% demand and maintenance costs.<br>demand must be met within ±10%.<br>power bills must be paid within deadline.<br>failed audits may impact operating licenses.<br>difficulty cannot be changed in-game.
