T_NUC_XENON;XENON ACTIVITY RATE
D_NUC_XENON;This gauge measures how much Xenon is produced per minute.<br><br>Xenon-135 is naturally produced by the decay of Iodine-135. Higher core power will cause Xenon to build up faster.
T_NUC_XENON_CONCENTRACION;XENON BUILDUP
D_NUC_XENON_CONCENTRACION;Measures the concentration of Xenon-135 in the fuel cells.<br><br>When poisons such as Xenon accumulate to extreme levels, they will render the plant unable to meet the city's energy demands.
T_NUC_YODO;IODINE ACTIVITY RATE
D_NUC_YODO;This gauge measures how much Iodine is produced per minute.<br><br>Iodine-135 comprises 7% of the fission products from Uranium-235. Higher core power will cause Iodine to build up faster.
T_NUC_YODO_CONCENTRACION;IODINE BUILDUP
D_NUC_YODO_CONCENTRACION;Measures the concentration of Iodine-135 in the fuel cells.<br><br>Iodine-135 decays to Xenon-135 in about 6.5 hours.
