T_PanelReactorPowerBoard;Reactor Power Board
D_PanelReactorPowerBoard;Displays real-time information on reactor power levels: core activity, absorption capabilities of control rods, levels of Xenon, Iodine, and Boron concentrations.<br><color=red>Red</color> signifies a boost or rise in reactivity.<br><color=green>Green</color> indicates absorption or decrease in reactivity.<br>Additionally, various colors represent gases, all of which diminish reactivity to varying degrees.
