T_GB_EnergiaTermica;THERMAL POWER VS. ELECTRIC POWER
D_GB_EnergiaTermica;Green bars indicate the total thermal energy available in the core measured in Megawatts Thermal (MWt). Blue bars indicate the total electrical power delivered by the transformers measured in Megawatts Electric (MWe). Each bar represents one minute.
T_TUR_TRIP;TURBINE TRIP
