T_RES_TEMP;RESISTOR BANK | TEMPERATURE
D_RES_TEMP;Temperatures will rise when unit is under load. Excessive temperatures will cause unit to wear out and lose integrity. Loss of integrity will ultimately lead to an explosion, which can be deadly if you are standing nearby.
T_RES_CONECTADO;RESISTOR BANK | ENERGIZED
D_RES_CONECTADO;When illuminated, the individual Resistor Blocks are energized.<br><br><b>Disconnect unit before touching Resistor Blocks.</b>
T_PalancaMecanica_RES_Encendido;RESISTOR BANK | CONNECT
D_PalancaMecanica_RES_Encendido;This switch connects this unit to the internal power distributor. Unit is energized when the green light is illuminated below.<br><br><b>DO NOT touch the resistor blocks when energized.</b>
T_PalancaMecanica_RES_ByPass;RESISTOR BANK | BYPASS
D_PalancaMecanica_RES_ByPass;This switch overrides any resistor bank settings made in the Control Room.
