D_0_GEN_OUTPUT_TURBINA_TE;This meter measures the rotational force, or torque, produced by each turbine.<br>Torque is a crucial parameter indicating the amount of rotational force applied by the turbine's blades.<br>The torque reading is expressed as a percentage of the turbine's total capacity.

