AO_COMANDO_AYUDA_0;Request AO to follow you wherever you go.<br><br>If AO cannot access your location, it will wait at the nearest point or attempt to find a way around.<br><br>If AO is performing any operational task, it will stop immediately to comply with this command.<br><br>Note: AO cannot follow you outside the facility.
AO_COMANDO_AYUDA_1;Request AO to stop following you.<br><br>If AO has permission to roam, it will start doing so, otherwise, it will wait at its current location.<br><br>This command will not work if AO is not following you.
AO_COMANDO_AYUDA_2;Request AO to scan the nearest devices, cables, and pipes from its current location.<br><br>This command will not work if AO is in the control room.
AO_COMANDO_AYUDA_3;Request AO to scan all devices, cables, and pipes in the area you specify.<br><br>If AO is performing any operational task, it will stop immediately to comply with this command.
AO_COMANDO_AYUDA_4;Request AO to scan the specified device.<br><br>If AO is performing any operational task, it will stop immediately to comply with this command.
AO_COMANDO_AYUDA_5;Requests AO to cancel the command in progress.
