T_NUC_COMPUERTA_MANT_OPEN;Core Access Gate Open
D_NUC_COMPUERTA_MANT_OPEN;The Core gate that allows access to the interior for maintenance is open if the light is flashing. The reactor cannot be operated in this situation. The freight pumps will be deactivated for safety.

T_NUC_COMPUERTA_SUP_OPEN;Upper Core Access Gate Open
D_NUC_COMPUERTA_SUP_OPEN;The upper Core gate that allows access to the interior for maintenance is open if the light is flashing. The reactor cannot be operated in this situation. The freight pumps will be deactivated for safety.

