FLOODGATE_CORE_MANTENIMIENTO_ABIERTA;Core Floodgate Open

T_NUC_FLOODGATE_MANT_OPEN;Core Floodgate Open
D_NUC_FLOODGATE_MANT_OPEN;The Core floodgate that allows access to the external vessel is open if the light is flashing. The freight pumps will be deactivated for safety.

T_NUC_FLOODGATE_SUP_OPEN;Upper Core Floodgate Open
D_NUC_FLOODGATE_SUP_OPEN;The upper Core floodgate that allows access to the external vessel is open if the light is flashing. The freight pumps will be deactivated for safety.

