SIEMPRE_CORRIENDO_OFF;Always running: OFF
AY_CONTROL_TERMAL;SPENT FUEL DISPOSAL@High-level nuclear waste is very toxic to the operator and to the surrounding environment. It must be transported and disposed of in a controlled, responsible manner.<br><br>This plant includes a crane gripper that can safely transport spent fuel cells from the core to its storage cask in the Fuel Depot. The crane can be operated remotely via the tablet's "Operational Tasks" app, minimizing physical risks to the operator.<br><br>Disposed fuel cells can no longer be reused.@Ayuda_COMBUSTIBLE
AY_EXTRACCION_COMBUSTIBLE;FUEL CELLS@New fuel cells are stored in the Fuel Depot above the Reactor Core Room. Up to eight new fuel cells can be purchased in the tablet's "Order Parts & Supplies" app. It is safe to stand next to a new, undamaged fuel cell because it is not yet emitting any high-level radioactive byproducts.<br><br>The NAEC has approved the use of Class B and Class C fuel cells in this reactor. Class C blocks burn stronger but faster than Class B blocks. Researchers are still discovering why Class C fuel cells seem to strengthen each other when installed together.@Ayuda_COMBUSTIBLE
