NOTIFICACION_CORTE_PROGRAMADO_SUMINISTRO_EXTERNO_MOTIVO_1;preventive maintenance on high-voltage lines.
NOTIFICACION_CORTE_PROGRAMADO_SUMINISTRO_EXTERNO_MOTIVO_2;update and improvement of the electrical distribution system.
NOTIFICACION_CORTE_PROGRAMADO_SUMINISTRO_EXTERNO_MOTIVO_3;mandatory technical inspection at the regional substation.
NOTIFICACION_CORTE_PROGRAMADO_SUMINISTRO_EXTERNO_MOTIVO_4;urgent repairs due to infrastructure damage.
NOTIFICACION_CORTE_PROGRAMADO_SUMINISTRO_EXTERNO_MOTIVO_5;replacement of critical components in the general supply network.
NOTIFICACION_CORTE_PROGRAMADO_SUMINISTRO_EXTERNO_MOTIVO_6;technical tests for resistance and safety of the power lines.
NOTIFICACION_CORTE_PROGRAMADO_SUMINISTRO_EXTERNO_MOTIVO_7;coordinated works with regional authorities on electrical infrastructure.
NOTIFICACION_CORTE_PROGRAMADO_SUMINISTRO_EXTERNO_MOTIVO_8;emergency drill to test alternative backup systems.
NOTIFICACION_CORTE_NO_PROGRAMADO_SUMINISTRO_EXTERNO;Nucleares, the city grid service to your location was interrupted at {0} due to {3} We hope to restore power by {1} ({2} hours). We regret any inconvenience.
