T_Retention_Tank_Pressure;RETENTION TANK | PRESSURE
D_Retention_Tank_Pressure;High pressure may block the Steam Jet Ejector or reduce its efficiency. To release pressure, open the red Retention Tank Vent in the Condenser Room.
T_SEL_POTENCIA_BOMBA_VACIO;ELECTRIC VACUUM PUMP | MODE
D_SEL_POTENCIA_BOMBA_VACIO;Startup Mode: High-powered mode to quickly establish vacuum.<br><br>Operating Mode: Low-powered mode to sustain an existing vacuum.<br><br>Vacuum pump can be stopped once Motive Flow Rate is 100%.
T_BOMBA_VACIO_ENCENDER;ELECTRIC VACUUM PUMP | START
D_BOMBA_VACIO_ENCENDER;The electric vacuum pump creates a vacuum in the condenser by spinning water received from the retention tank.
T_BOMBA_VACIO_APAGAR;ELECTRIC VACUUM PUMP | STOP
D_BOMBA_VACIO_APAGAR;The electric vacuum pump can be disabled once you are sure that the Steam Jet Ejector will not fall below 100% motive flow rate.
T_CajaPanelBombaVacioCon;Vacuum System Panel
D_CajaPanelBombaVacioCon;Displays the main valves that control steam flow, suction, discharge, and venting within the vacuum system.<br>Proper valve configuration is essential for efficient vacuum generation and safe turbine operation.
