BA_T_VSYNC_AYUDA_0;Does not sync frames with the monitor. Allows higher FPS and lower input latency but can cause screen tearing and less stable visuals.
BA_T_VSYNC_AYUDA_1;[Recommended option] Synchronizes frames with the monitor to prevent screen tearing. Provides a more stable image but may limit FPS and slightly increase input latency.
BA_T_AnisotropicFiltering_Ayuda_0;Textures viewed at sharp angles look blurrier. Improves performance but reduces detail on floors and distant surfaces.
BA_T_AnisotropicFiltering_Ayuda_1;Improves texture clarity at angles with a moderate performance cost. Surfaces look sharper than when disabled.
BA_T_AnisotropicFiltering_Ayuda_2;[Recommended option] Maximizes texture sharpness at angles. Provides the clearest surfaces, with the highest performance cost.
BA_T_TextureCalidad_Ayuda_0;Uses full-resolution textures for maximum detail. Offers the sharpest visuals with the highest memory usage.
BA_T_TextureCalidad_Ayuda_1;[Recommended option] Reduces texture resolution slightly. Keeps good detail while lowering memory usage.
BA_T_TextureCalidad_Ayuda_2;Uses smaller textures to save memory. Surfaces look softer and less detailed.
BA_T_TextureCalidad_Ayuda_3;Minimizes texture resolution for maximum performance. Visual detail is significantly reduced.
BA_T_Exterior_Ayuda_0;Disables exterior detail and effects. Improves performance but makes outdoor areas look simpler.
BA_T_Exterior_Ayuda_1;Uses minimal exterior detail and reduced effects. Boosts performance with modest visual quality.
BA_T_Exterior_Ayuda_2;Provides a mix of exterior detail and performance. Outdoor areas look good without a heavy cost.
BA_T_Exterior_Ayuda_3;[Recommended option] Enables full exterior detail and effects. Offers the best visuals with the highest performance impact.
BA_T_LUCES_DINAMICAS_AYUDA_2;[Recommended option] Provides moderately detailed real-time lighting. A good compromise between visuals and performance.
BA_T_LUCES_DINAMICAS_AYUDA_3;Uses full real-time lighting with detailed effects. Offers the best visuals at a higher performance cost.
BA_T_FECHAS_ESPECIALES;Enable minigames on special dates
T_FechasEspeciales;Enable minigames on special dates, such as Christmas gifts and Christmas decorations.
ESTADOS_ESCOTILLAS_HATCH;HATCH
ESTADOS_ESCOTILLAS_SAFE;SAFE
ESTADOS_ESCOTILLAS_OPEN;OPEN
ESTADOS_ESCOTILLAS_SHUT;SHUT
AY_AVISO_NAVIDAD;SPECIAL EVENTS@<b>INTERNAL MEMO – NUCLEARES OPERATIONS</b><br>Attention Reactor Operators! As part of our Seasonal Morale Improvement Program, a limited number of holiday gift boxes have been… strategically misplaced throughout the facility.<br>These gifts are not marked, not on any map, and not part of standard operating procedures. Operators who manage to locate them will be rewarded with Prestige Points.<br>This initiative is temporary, unofficially festive, and absolutely does not interfere with reactor safety (probably).<br>Stay alert. Check corners. Trust no corridor.<br><br>Nucleares Management@Ayuda_NAVIDAD
