D_SUM_ELE00_SETMODO;Automatic Mode: Diesel Generator will power the plant automatically when the turbine generator is not operating.<br><br>Manual Mode: You must manually start or stop the Diesel Generator. Note: If the Control Room is not powered, you must travel to the Diesel Generator Building to operate these controls.
