SAVEGAME_ERROR_SIN_SLOT;There are no free slots. Please delete an old saved progress file.
T_REG_VALVULA_ENTRADA_EJECTOR_EVA;Startup Motive Steam Inlet Valve
D_REG_VALVULA_ENTRADA_EJECTOR_EVA;Controls the flow of motive steam from the <b>steam generators</b> into the ejector during startup. Adjusting this valve determines how much steam is used to generate vacuum in the condenser before the turbine becomes operational. Proper regulation ensures efficient startup without wasting steam.
T_REG_VALVULA_ENTRADA_EJECTOR_TUR;Operational Motive Steam Inlet Valve
D_REG_VALVULA_ENTRADA_EJECTOR_TUR;Controls the flow of motive steam from the <b>steam turbines</b> to the ejector during normal operation. This valve allows the system to maintain vacuum in the condenser using a portion of the steam extracted from the turbines, reducing the need for fresh steam and improving overall efficiency.
T_REG_VALVULA_RETORNO_CONDENSADOR;Condensate Return Valve
D_REG_VALVULA_RETORNO_CONDENSADOR;Controls the flow of gases and steam from the retention tank back to the condenser. This valve should remain closed while the vacuum pump is operating, as an open return path can reduce pump efficiency and compromise vacuum levels.
T_EJECTOR_TANQUE_RETENCION;Retention Tank Level Indicator
D_EJECTOR_TANQUE_RETENCION;Shows the retention tank's fill level. If empty, the vacuum pump loses gas supply and can't maintain vacuum; if full, ejector discharge is blocked, causing backpressure and increased condenser pressure.
Condensate_Flow_Rate;Condensate Flow Rate
T_CON_TASA_CONDENSACION;Condensate Flow Rate
D_CON_TASA_CONDENSACION;Indicates the amount of steam being condensed into water each second. Higher values mean more steam is available and being efficiently condensed. A low value may suggest that little steam remains or that condensation efficiency is dropping.
Extraction_Flow;Extraction Flow
T_CON_FLUJO_SALIDA;Extraction Flow
D_CON_FLUJO_SALIDA;Indicates the flow rate of feedwater returning from the condenser to the steam generators.
liquid_balance;Liquid balance
vapor_balance;Steam balance

END_VERSION;V 2.2.25.209 --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

START_VERSION;V 2.2.25.210 ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

T_Motive_Steam_Flow_Rate;STEAM JET EJECTOR | MOTIVE FLOW RATE
D_Motive_Steam_Flow_Rate;Indicates the amount of steam entering the ejector to generate vacuum in the condenser. This steam may come from the steam generators during startup or from the steam turbines during normal operation.

END_VERSION;V 2.2.25.210 ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

