AY_EventoDemandaProgramada;SCHEDULED INCREASE IN DEMAND@The city has communicated a requirement to increase demand due to a scheduled event. Prepare the reactor to meet this higher demand.<br><br>The first and last hour of the increase count as stabilization; you do not need to meet the full requirement during those hours.<br><br>Check the service compliance monitor for goal status.@AY_FISION_REVERTIDA
AY_EventoDemandaEmergencia;INCREASE IN EMERGENCY DEMAND@The city has communicated a requirement to increase demand due to an emergency. Prepare the reactor to meet this higher demand.<br><br>You must meet the requirement to help avoid citywide blackouts.<br><br><b>You will be paid for each hour in which you meet the demand.</b>@AY_FISION_REVERTIDA
