INFO_DETALLE_02Q;TO LOAD THE CORE POOL COOLANT TANK, VALVES M01 AND M03 MUST BE CLOSED AND VALVE M02 MUST BE OPEN.
INFO_DETALLE_03Q;TO LOAD THE PRIMARY CIRCUIT COOLANT TANK, VALVES M01 AND M02 MUST BE CLOSED AND VALVE M03 MUST BE OPEN.
