DES_INV_FUEL_CAN;Used to manually refuel the emergency generators.
DES_INV_OIL_CAN;Used to lubricate the circulation pumps. Proper lubrication is required before starting a pump.
DES_INV_CONTROLADOR_BDC;A microcontroller that enables remote operation of the control rods through a complex hydraulic system.
DES_INV_BATERIAS;Store electrical power for use during emergencies if all other power systems fail. They must be installed in the emergency racks.
DES_INV_BATERIAS_AO;A rechargeable battery for the Operational Assistant robot.
DES_INV_TRAJE_PROTECTOR;Allows you to safely explore the plant during toxic gas leaks or radioactive contamination.
DES_INV_PINZA_REPARADORA;Used to repair high-voltage cables throughout the plant.
DES_INV_SOLDADORA;Used to repair minor damage and leaks in certain containers.
DES_INV_CAJA_ELECTRODOS;Replacement electrodes for the welder.
DES_INV_REPUESTO_RESISTOR;Used to absorb excess power generated by the turbines.
DES_INV_FUSIBLE;Protect the plant’s critical systems from overvoltage and other electrical faults.
DES_INV_RECARGA_BORO;Provides transportation and replenishment of Boron supplies.
DES_INV_RECARGA_NAOH;Provides transportation and replenishment of NaOH supplies.
DES_INV_RECARGA_FUEL;Provides transportation and replenishment of Fuel supplies.
DES_INV_BARRA_DE_CONTROL;Absorbs neutrons to regulate or stop the reactor’s nuclear reaction.

